<title>USA: Harvey Cty USD 373, Kan. won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Harvey Cty USD 373, Kan. won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $10 million of Harvey Cty USD 373, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.66 percent.</p>
